<title>USA: Price to buy back 2 million shares.</title>
<headline>Price to buy back 2 million shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Price Communications Corp said on Monday it will repurchase up to two million of its common shares on the open market.</p>
<p>Price shares were trading at 9-3/8 on Monday, close to their 52-week high of 9-1/2.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
